Short Summary of Rights & Obligations:
1. You may manufacture, distribute, and sell products based on this 
   PISCES/Piscator hardware design.
2. If you modify any design files in this repository (e.g., the ALU, 
   the DMA pump, or top interconnects) and distribute them, you MUST 
